OL,3,GNEWSANew council faces 'very
OL,4,Achallenging' finances - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new West Surrey Council "will
OL,7,Foperate in a very challenging financial
OL,8,Fenvironment, with significant budgetary
OL,9,Fpressures and limited financial
OL,10,Fresources", new papers show.
OL,12,FA report presented to the shadow
OL,13,Fauthority's cabinet shows the new
OL,14,Fauthority will face a #4.92m annual
OL,15,Fshortfall in their accounts, reported
OL,16,Fby the six constituent councils it will
OL,17,Freplace from 1 April.
OL,19,FEarly Q1 figures suggest overspends of
OL,20,Fbetween #3.97m and #536,000 from four
OL,21,Fof the councils will need to be
OL,22,Fbalanced.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
