OL,3,GNEWSANew council faces 'very
OL,4,Achallenging' finances - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe long-term picture presents further
OL,7,Fchallenges with the six boroughs adding
OL,8,Fabout #4bn in debt on to West Surrey's
OL,9,Fbalance sheet, according to the Local
OL,10,FDemocracy Reporting Service.
